Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:06.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,On November 15th, 2023 YG\NEntertainment posted a notice that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:11.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,stopped a fandom cold Their most\Nanticipated trainee the girl fans had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,already crowned before she ever\Nofficially debuted would not be in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:20.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's first music video Six members\Nwould go on without her One would stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:26.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,behind unnamed in a building full of\Nmirrors What happened next is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:31.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,strangest debut arc in modern K-pop a\Ngroup that broke YouTube records
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:34.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,without its center a record label that\Nrefused to replace her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:39.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a nineteen-year-old who came back\Nfrom the edge of erasure to become the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:45.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,defining idol of her generation This\Nis the story of Jung Ahyeon and why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:48.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,the industry now calls her the fifth\Ngeneration's it girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon The fifth generation it girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act One Chuncheon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:46.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Before the pyramids of light and the\Ndome-sized crowds there is a map dot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:51.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,two hours east of Seoul Chuncheon a\Nlakeside city in Gangwon Province
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:57.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,known for its dumplings its autumn\Nleaves and almost nothing else in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:02.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,global music economy On\NApril 11th, 2007 Jung Ahyeon was born
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:07.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,there By her own fans' accounting she\Nwas studying English at five and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:11.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mandarin by seven a trilingual\Nchildhood in a city that has produced
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,exactly one global idol
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:28.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Somewhere between eight and ten years\Nold she entered the system that would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:34.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,rebuild her life around a single\Nobjective YG Entertainment the company
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:39.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,of BigBang of 2NE1 of Blackpink\Nruns the most selective and most
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:44.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,secretive training program in K-pop\NTrainees practice six to ten hours a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:50.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,day for years without a debut date\Nwithout a guarantee and in most cases
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:55.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,without the public ever learning their\Nname Ahyeon lasted five years in that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:03:01.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,machine Hold on to that number Five\Nyears of auditions evaluations and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:05.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,eliminations before the outside world\Nsaw her face move
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:23.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,The first public signal came on New\NYear's Day 2023 A trailer called YG
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:27.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Next Movement ninety seconds of\Nanonymous trainees dancing like the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:33.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,floor owed them money The internet did\Nwhat the internet does it froze frames
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:38.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,zoomed faces and started building fan\Naccounts for children whose names had
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:44.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,never been spoken Eleven days later YG\Nbegan answering One by one it released
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:49.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,live performance videos of the members\NAhyeon was the second reveal She was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:53.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,fifteen years old performing\Nchoreography she had been drilling for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,half a decade and the comments read\Nlike a launch event
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:14.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind the scenes the selection was\Nbeing filmed Last Evaluation YG's own
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:20.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,documentary series followed seven\Ntrainees competing for a lineup no one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:24.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,would guarantee The footage showed a\Ncompany deliberately withholding the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:29.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,answer letting the girls and the\Naudience sit inside the uncertainty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:35.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon made the label's shortlist of\Nfive And in those episodes viewers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:39.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,started using a nickname that would\Nfollow her for the next three years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:43.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Little Jennie The company had done\Nthis before The question was whether
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:46.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,lightning could strike the same\Nbuilding twice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Two The voice they heard first
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:22.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here is the detail that separates\NAhyeon's origin from every trainee
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:29.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,handbook Before BABYMONSTER had a name\Na logo or a debut date a video leaked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:33.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,out of the practice rooms a teenage\Ngirl singing Charlie Puth's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:39.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dangerously alone one take no stage no\Nstyling It spread the way genuine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:44.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,things spread unannounced and\Nunkillable And then it reached the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:49.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,person who wrote the song Charlie Puth\Ndidn't just notice it He said publicly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:52.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,that he had heard the cover and that\Nthe voice had stopped him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:09.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,On May 14th, 2023 the group released\NDream a pre-debut single that hit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:13.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,number one on Billboard's Hot Trending\NSongs chart before the group had
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:18.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,officially debuted The YouTube channel\Ncrossed one million subscribers in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:23.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,fifty-two days the fastest in K-pop\Ngirl group history at the time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:28.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Industry watchers kept asking the same\Nquestion why was YG building so much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:33.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,momentum for a group with no release\Ndate The answer it turned out was that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:37.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,the date kept moving because the\Nlineup wasn't finished One voice was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:38.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,missing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:53.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inside the company Ahyeon was being\Nshaped as a specific weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:59.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,main vocalist lead rapper lead dancer\Ncenter That is four job descriptions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:05.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,on one person and each one is normally\Na full-time specialty The rare idols
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:10.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,who carry all four are the ones the\Nindustry builds eras around YG had a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:15.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,term for what it saw in her and fans\Nhad theirs Both meant the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,the group's identity was designed\Naround a voice that could carry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:23.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,hip-hop swagger on one track and pure\Npop ache on the next without changing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,costumes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:39.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Puth thread didn't end with the\Ncover Two years later when the group
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,finally released its first album track\Nfour would be called Like That
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:48.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,written and gifted by Charlie Puth\Nhimself explicitly in response to that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:53.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,practice-room video Remember the\Nsequence because it matters a cover
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:58.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,made in anonymity went up the chain\Nreached the original artist and came
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:02.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,back down as a song on a debut album\NIn an industry where Western features
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:07.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,are bought and negotiated one of the\Nbiggest pop writers on Earth handed a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,debut track to a trainee he had never\Nmet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Three The wait
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:46.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,November 15th, 2023 The notice was\Nthree sentences long YG announced that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:51.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon would not participate in the\Ngroup's debut activities citing health
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:57.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,and personal circumstances She would\Nremain a member of BABYMONSTER No
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:03.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,timeline No diagnosis No footage In\NK-pop where a nine-month hiatus can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:08.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,quietly end a career the announcement\Nread like a countdown nobody could see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:10.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,She was sixteen years old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:25.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twelve days later the six-member\NBABYMONSTER released Batter Up The
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:29.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,numbers were absurd twenty-two point\Nfive nine million views in twenty-four
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:35.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,hours at that moment the most-viewed\Ndebut music video in K-pop history One
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:40.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,hundred million views in eighteen days\NThe group had arrived loudly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:46.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,undeniably and every article every\Ncomment every frame of choreography
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:52.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,carried the same asterisk Six of seven\NThe debut was a triumph shaped exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,like an absence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:08.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty-two point five nine million\Nviews in the first twenty-four hours
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:24.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,February 2024 brought Stuck In The\NMiddle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:29.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,a ballad-adjacent single that\Nshowcased the group's softer register
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:35.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Again six members Again the comments\NBy then the absence had become the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:39.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's most-discussed member Fan\Ncampaigns for her return ran in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:44.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,multiple languages and multiple time\Nzones the fandom's nickname for the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:49.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,wait worth the wait stopped being a\Nslogan and became a prediction Inside
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:54.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,YG sources say the decision had\Nalready been made The company did not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:59.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,refilm did not re-cast did not\Nre-shuffle It waited for her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:17.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the early spring of 2024 YG posted\Na notice that fans screenshot like a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:21.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,birth certificate\NAhyeon would rejoin the group The
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:26.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,seven-member rebrand was baked into\Nthe identity itself the debut EP would
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:31.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,be stylized BABYMONS7ER the numeral\Nseven welded into the wordmark Think
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:38.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,about how rare that is Labels replace\Nmembers Labels delay debuts Labels
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.91,0:11:43.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,almost never architect the comeback of\Na trainee who never debuted into the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:47.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's founding mythology The missing\Ngirl was about to become the founding
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:48.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,story
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:13.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Four Worth the wait
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:38.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,April 1st, 2024 Seven members\NBABYMONS7ER The debut EP pulled over
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:42.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,four hundred sixty thousand pre-orders\Nand landed at number three on Korea's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:46.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,Circle Album Chart The title track\NSheesh was engineered as a statement
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:52.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,brass stabs chant hooks a drop built\Nfor stadiums and it climbed to the top
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:56.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,ten of the Circle Digital Chart while\Nposting the highest Spotify debut of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:13:01.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,any K-pop girl group that year The\Ncenter of its choreography and of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:05.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,nearly every camera move was the girl\Nwho had missed the countdown
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:21.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,And there on the album sat the\Nfull-circle moment Like That Written
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.35,0:13:26.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,by Charlie Puth Gifted by his own\Naccount because a practice-room cover
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:30.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,had once stopped him mid-scroll Ahyeon\Ndidn't just get her debut
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:34.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,she got a debut where one of the\Nworld's biggest pop writers had
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:38.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,personally co-signed the voice the\Nindustry spent sixteen months waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:43.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,to hear Critics noticed what YG had\Nbet on the group's seven-member sound
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,finally had its missing ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:14:00.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,The press cycle had a field day with\Nthe nickname Little Jennie inherited
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,from her Last Evaluation footage a\Ncomparison to the most famous it girl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:10.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the fourth generation It was meant\Nas a compliment It was also a cage the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:16.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,fifth generation did not need a repeat\Nit needed a first Ahyeon's answer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:21.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,across interviews and stages was not a\Nrejection of the comparison but a slow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:26.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,drowning of it a rapper's bite on\Nvariety shows live vocals that kept
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:30.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,getting steadier and a stage presence\Nthat made the nickname age faster than
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,anyone expected
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:47.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,The industry's verdict arrived through\Narithmetic Within two months of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:51.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,debuting the group was booked across\Nsix Asian territories on a fan-meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:56.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,tour selling twenty-six thousand\Ntickets in Tokyo alone Music show
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:15:01.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,stages turned into trending clips\Nweekly The machine that had spent 2019
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:08.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,through 2023 being called too slow too\Nquiet too old-fashioned YG's patient
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:13.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,scarcity-driven training model had\Njust produced the fastest-scaling girl
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:17.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,group of the new generation And at the\Ncenter of the frame was the one it had
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,refused to replace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:32.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Five The monster era
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:53.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,The singles kept the temperature up\NForever that July
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:58.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,ran the group's bright-powered\Nregister into summer But the real move
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:16:03.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,came on November 1st, 2024 DRIP the\Nfirst studio album Eight hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:08.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,twenty thousand copies in its first\Nweek for a group eleven months past
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:14.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,debut It crossed a million domestic\Ncopies landed on the Billboard 200 and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:19.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,its title track carried a co-sign no\None saw coming the demo was built by
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:23.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,G-Dragon The pupil of the company\Nhanded material by its architect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:39.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came the stat that redrew the\Ntour maps On January 25th and 26th
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:45.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,2025 BABYMONSTER opened their Hello\NMonsters world tour at the KSPO Dome
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:49.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,in Seoul the Olympic gymnastics arena\Nthat functions as K-pop's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:54.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,certification of arrival No girl group\Nhad ever headlined that venue faster
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:17:00.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,They were eight months past debut The\Ntour went on to play thirty-two shows
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:04.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,across twenty cities for roughly three\Nhundred thousand people with the Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:09.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,leg alone moving a hundred and fifty\Nthousand tickets at a record pace
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:27.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,November 29th, 2025 the MAMA Awards in\NHong Kong Ahyeon Pharita and Rora took
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:31.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,the stage for a medley from KPop Demon\NHunters and their performance of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:36.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Golden detonated the internet six\Npoint six eight million views the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:41.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,most-watched MAMA clip of the year\NThen came the part every idol learns
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:46.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,to dread the reaction economy Clips of\Nthe live vocals circulated with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:51.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,criticism attached Ahyeon's response\Nwas not a statement It was the next
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:56.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,stage and the one after that each one\Ntighter until the argument ran out of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:57.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,footage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:13.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six point six eight million views the\Nmost-watched MAMA stage of the year
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:31.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Zoom out and the year looks like this\Na million-copy album a dome-level
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:36.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,world tour four hundred forty thousand\Nfans through the turnstiles in twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:40.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,months and a fanbase that had watched\Na sixteen-year-old almost disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:44.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,and come back as the group's\Ngravitational center By the end of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:49.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,2025 the industry had stopped\Ndescribing BABYMONSTER as Blackpink's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:54.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,successors They were simply the\Nmonster era and Ahyeon was its face
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:06.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Six The it girl year
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:30.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,2026 opened like a victory lap In\NJanuary Really Like You spent five
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:34.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,consecutive days at number one on\NYouTube's Viral Fifty music chart The
